  Monetization Ideas
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write tutorials and courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tools and sell them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer consulting services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content on Dev.to/Medium&lt;/li&gt;
